sha1 = d197d9fb46e1802a7160368b38bf063b493f1be1

A list of files and directories removed is in README.DELETED.

No local modifications.

Upgrade Notes
-------------
1. Create temporary symlinks for SSL:
   $ ln -s priv/openssl /usr/include/
   $ ln -s libprivate_ssl.so /usr/lib/priv/libssl.so
   $ ln -s libprivate_crypto.so /usr/lib/priv/libcrypto.so

2. Configure the software:
   $ ./configure \
	--with-drill \
	--disable-gost \
	--disable-dane-ta-usage \
	ac_cv_header_dlfcn_h=no \
	LDFLAGS="-L/usr/lib/priv"
   Notes:
   - DANE-TA usage requires OpenSSL >= 1.1.0
   - Set ac_cv_header_dlfcn_h=no to disable dlopen*

3. Copy generated headers:
   $ cp ldns/{common.h,config.h,net.h,util.h} lib/libldns/ldns/

4. Remove the temporary symlinks:
   $ rm /usr/include/openssl /usr/lib/priv/libssl.so /usr/lib/priv/libcrypto.so
